==In the manga==
===Pokémon Adventures===
[[File:Office Worker female Adventures.png|thumb|180px|A female Clerk in [[Pokémon Adventures]]]]
Both male and female Clerks have appeared in Pokémon Adventures, although their roles are minor.

===={{MangaArc|Black & White}}====
A male and a female Clerk appeared in ''[[PS466|An Odd Speech]]'', listening to [[Ghetsis]]' speech.

A female Clerk briefly appeared in Nimbasa City in ''[[PS486|Unraveling Mysteries]]''.

A male Clerk and his superior was seen in ''[[PS489|Drawing Bridges]]'' amongst the Trainers waiting to get to cross the [[Driftveil Drawbridge]].

A female Clerk and a superior appeared in ''[[PS511|Dream a Little Dream]]'' as a {{un|Pokémon League}} participant.

===={{MangaArc|Sun, Moon, Ultra Sun & Ultra Moon}}====
In ''[[PASM19|Truth and the Mastermind Behind Team Skull]]'', a female Clerk was seen running away in horror from the [[Ultra Beast]]s that showed up in [[Alola]].

===={{MangaArc|Sword & Shield}}====
In ''[[PASS18|Chomp!! It's Dracovish]]'', a male Clerk who was a {{tc|Macro Cosmos's}} in disguise was sent with his cohorts to [[Route 9 Tunnel]] to dispose of a wild {{p|Dracovish}} that suddenly [[Dynamax]]ed. The Dracovish was saved by [[Marvin]], who used his [[Sniffler]] to stun everyone long enough for him to catch Dracovish and escape. Afterward, they reported their failure to [[Oleana]] and were ordered to stand by in [[Wyndon]].

